  "body": "According to https://matrix.org/docs/spec/push_gateway/r0.1.1#post-matrix-push-v1-notify, 200 is the only valid response code.\r\n\r\nWhat if there was an error talking to the upstream notification system? What if the request was invalid? What if we were overloaded? What if the push failed some sort of security check?",
